        Buttons:[{
          Actions:[{
            Cmd:"question_two",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"
          }],Label:"button_70",Name:"Next One ..."
        }],Label:"question_one_correct",Name:"First question: Correct",Texts:[{
          Text:"Thats correct.\\nIn Minecraft, a crafting table is an essential crafting station that allows players to create more advanced items and tools.\\nTo craft a crafting table, you need four wooden planks.\\nSimply place the wooden planks in a 2x2 crafting grid, leaving the center square empty, and you'll have your crafting table ready for use."
        }]
      },{
