          }],Label:"button_2",Name:"Start quiz"
        }],Name:"Start Quiz",Texts:[{
          Text:"Nice, lets start the quiz.... click on the start button when you are ready."
        }]
      },{
        Label:"question_two_correct",Name:"Second Question: Correct",Texts:[{
          Text:"Nice one. The End is a mysterious and otherworldly dimension in Minecraft, accessed through a portal generated after defeating the Ender Dragon.\\nIt is a desolate land with floating islands and obsidian pillars.\\nThe Ender Dragon is the final boss in Minecraft and resides in The End, guarding the End Portal and Ender Gateway."
        }]
